               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "ESS maybe even better:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "An extended basic service set (ESS) consists of all of the BSSs in the network. For all practical purposes, the ESSID identifies the same network as the SSID does",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
